{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܡܸܟ݂ܬܵܡ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܢܛܘܿܪܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܫܩܝܼܠܔ ܠܝܼ ܓܵܘܣܵܐ ܒܝܼܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܡܝܼܪܝܼ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ: ”ܡܵܪܝܼ ܝܘܸܬ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܵܒ݂ܬܵ‌ܐ ܠܲܝܬ ܠܝܼ ܫܒ݂ܘܿܩ ܡܸܢܘܼܟ݂.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܬ ܩܲܕܝܼܫܹ̈ܐ ܕܒܐܲܪܥܵܐ، ܕܝܼܢܵܐ ܚܩܝܼܪܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܒܘܼܣܵܡܝܼ ܒܝܼܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܝܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܙܵܝܕܝܼ ܐܘܼܠܨܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܐܵܢܝܼ ܕܪܵܚܛܝܼ ܒܵܬܪ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܐܚܹܪܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܹܐ ܨܲܢܨܸܠܸܢ ܢܘܼܩܵܝܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܕܕܸܡܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܹܐ ܡܲܕܟܸܪܸܢ ܫܸܡܵܢܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܥܲܠܔ ܣܸܦܘܵܬ‌ܝܼ̈.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܣܵܗܡܝܼ ܘܟܵܣܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܢ݇ܬ ܕܒ݂ܝܼܩܵܐ ܝܘܸܬ ܒܐܝܼܕܘܼܟ݂ ܦܸܫܟܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܝܘܼܠܹ̈ܐ ܢܦܝܼܠܔ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܐܸܠܝܼ ܒܕܘܼܟܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܒܲܣܝܼܡܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܘܼܦ ܝܵܪܬܘܼܬ‌ܝܼ ܫܦܝܼܪܵܗ̇ ܒܥܲܝܢܝܼ̈.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܒܲܪܟܸܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܕܥܒ݂ܝܼܕ ܠܹܗ ܡܸܠܟܵܐ ܐܸܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܘܼܦ ܒܠܲܝܠܵܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܟܹܐ ܬܲܥܠܸܡ ܠܝܼ ܪܸܥܝܵܢܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܬܸܒ݂ ܠܝܼ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܲܠܩܘܼܒ݂ܠܝܼ ܐܲܡܝܼܢܵܐܝܼܬ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܡ̣ܢ ܝܲܡܝܼܢܝܼ ܝܠܹܗ، ܠܹܐ ܫܵܥܫܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܬ ܐܵܗܵܐ، ܚܕܹܐ ܠܹܗ ܠܸܒܝܼ ܘܦܨܝܼܚ ܠܵܗ̇ ܓܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܘܼܦ ܦܲܓ݂ܪܝܼ ܒܸܬ ܫܵܪܹܐ ܒܫܲܝܢܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܠܹܐ ܫܵܒ݂ܩܹܬ ܠܓܵܢܝܼ ܒܫܝܘܿܠܔ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܹܐ ܝܵܗܒܹܬ ܠܩܲܕܝܼܫܘܼܟ݂ ܠܸܚܙܵܝܵܐ ܚܪܵܒ݂ܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܡܲܕܥܸܬ ܠܝܼ ܐܘܼܪܚܵܐ ܕܚܲܝܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܘܼܒ݂ܵܥܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܚܲܕܘܼܝܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܐܝܼܬ ܒܗܸܙܘܼܪܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܣܵܡܹ̈ܐ ܒܝܲܡܝܼܢܘܼܟ݂ ܠܥܵܠܲܡ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}